  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Steering Committee and SDG 4 Monitoring in LAC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAC has developed the Regional Coordination Mechanism, a technical-political dialogue strategy, to deepen educational cooperation efforts that support countries on their way to achieving the SDG 4. This mechanism, established in 2018, is led by the ministers of education of the region and supported by the Regional Steering Committee (RSC) and UNESCO Santiago as Executive Secretariat. This project aims to develop the Regional Steering Committee Workplan for 2024 - 2025 and to monitor the progress in achieving the SDG 4 targets.</narrative>
  </description>
